    <entry>
      <title>Skynet 源码剖析：从 main 到 bootstrap 的启动流程</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/11/skynet-source-analysis-startup/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/11/skynet-source-analysis-startup/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>在 Linux 环境下配置并启动 skynet 之后，为了更好地理解整个框架的运行机制，下一步就应该从源码入手。skynet 的底层核心是 C 语言实现，而 Lua 脚本主要用于业务层开发，因此我们可以先从 C 代码开始，了解它是如何完成框架启动的。</p><h2 id="1-入口函数与初始化"><a href="#1-入口函数与初始化" class="headerlink" title="1. 入口函数与初始化"></a>1. 入口函数与初始化</h2><p>我们平时启动 skynet 时使用下面的命令：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">./skynet example/config<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这条命令实际会调用 skynet 的入口函数 main()，并把配置文件路径传入其中。在这个函数里，程序会依次完成以下几个关键步骤：</p><ul><li>读取配置文件路径</li><li>初始化共享 Lua 资源</li><li>初始化全局环境与线程相关数据</li><li>初始化 Lua 虚拟机</li><li>加载并执行配置脚本</li><li>读取配置项</li><li>调用真正的框架启动函数</li></ul><p>下面是这个入口函数的核心逻辑：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> argc, <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *argv[])</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *config_file = <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (argc &gt; <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>        config_file = argv[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>];<br>    &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Need a config file. Please read skynet wiki : https://github.com/cloudwu/skynet/wiki/Config\n&quot;</span><br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;usage: skynet configfilename\n&quot;</span>);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    luaS_initshr();<br>    skynet_globalinit();<br>    skynet_env_init();<br>    sigign();<br><br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">skynet_config</span> <span class="hljs-title">config</span>;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">lua_State</span> *<span class="hljs-title">L</span> =</span> luaL_newstate();<br>    luaL_openlibs(L);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> err = luaL_loadbufferx(L, load_config, <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(load_config), <span class="hljs-string">&quot;=[skynet config]&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;t&quot;</span>);<br>    assert(err == LUA_OK);<br><br>    lua_pushstring(L, config_file);<br>    err = lua_pcall(L, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (err) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s\n&quot;</span>, lua_tostring(L, <span class="hljs-number">-1</span>));<br>        lua_close(L);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    _init_env(L);<br><br>    config.thread = optint(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;thread&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-number">8</span>);<br>    config.module_path = optstring(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;cpath&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;./cservice/?.so&quot;</span>);<br>    config.harbor = optint(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;harbor&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    config.bootstrap = optstring(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;bootstrap&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;snlua bootstrap&quot;</span>);<br>    config.daemon = optstring(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;daemon&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br>    config.logger = optstring(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;logger&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br>    config.logservice = optstring(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;logservice&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;logger&quot;</span>);<br>    config.profile = optboolean(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;profile&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br><br>    lua_close(L);<br>    skynet_start(&amp;config);<br>    skynet_globalexit();<br>    luaS_exitshr();<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个过程可以概括为一句话：先准备好运行环境，再把配置内容解析出来，最后由真正的启动逻辑把 skynet 拉起来。</p><h2 id="2-配置结构体：skynet-config"><a href="#2-配置结构体：skynet-config" class="headerlink" title="2. 配置结构体：skynet_config"></a>2. 配置结构体：skynet_config</h2><p>在 skynet 的源码中，启动时需要的核心配置被封装在一个结构体里，这个结构体里保存了多个重要项：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">skynet_config</span> &#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> thread;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> harbor;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> profile;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *daemon;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *module_path;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *bootstrap;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *logger;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *logservice;<br>&#125;;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这些字段的含义非常关键：</p><ul><li><code>thread</code>：启动的工作线程数量。</li><li><code>harbor</code>：节点编号，用于集群和跨节点通信。</li><li><code>profile</code>：是否开启性能统计。</li><li><code>daemon</code>：是否以守护进程方式运行。</li><li><code>module_path</code>：C 服务模块的路径。</li><li><code>bootstrap</code>：第一个启动的服务以及参数。</li><li><code>logger</code>：日志输出目标。</li><li><code>logservice</code>：日志服务名称。</li></ul><h2 id="3-真正启动-skynet：skynet-start"><a href="#3-真正启动-skynet：skynet-start" class="headerlink" title="3. 真正启动 skynet：skynet_start()"></a>3. 真正启动 skynet：skynet_start()</h2><p>入口函数最后会调用一个名为 <code>skynet_start()</code> 的函数，这个函数是整个启动流程的核心。它会依次完成各个子模块的初始化工作：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">skynet_start</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> skynet_config *config)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">sigaction</span> <span class="hljs-title">sa</span>;</span><br>    sa.sa_handler = &amp;handle_hup;<br>    sa.sa_flags = SA_RESTART;<br>    sigfillset(&amp;sa.sa_mask);<br>    sigaction(SIGHUP, &amp;sa, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (config-&gt;daemon) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (daemon_init(config-&gt;daemon)) &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    skynet_harbor_init(config-&gt;harbor);<br>    skynet_handle_init(config-&gt;harbor);<br>    skynet_mq_init();<br>    skynet_module_init(config-&gt;module_path);<br>    skynet_timer_init();<br>    skynet_socket_init();<br>    skynet_profile_enable(config-&gt;profile);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">skynet_context</span> *<span class="hljs-title">ctx</span> =</span> skynet_context_new(config-&gt;logservice, config-&gt;logger);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ctx == <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Can&#x27;t launch %s service\n&quot;</span>, config-&gt;logservice);<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    &#125;<br><br>    bootstrap(ctx, config-&gt;bootstrap);<br><br>    start(config-&gt;thread);<br><br>    skynet_harbor_exit();<br>    skynet_socket_free();<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (config-&gt;daemon) &#123;<br>        daemon_exit(config-&gt;daemon);<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这段代码的大体顺序如下：</p><ol><li>注册信号处理逻辑。</li><li>按需初始化守护进程。</li><li>初始化节点、句柄、消息队列、模块加载、定时器、网络和性能统计等模块。</li><li>创建一个日志服务实例。</li><li>启动 bootstrap 引导模块。</li><li>启动工作线程，真正进入服务调度。</li></ol><h2 id="4-初始化第一个服务：logger"><a href="#4-初始化第一个服务：logger" class="headerlink" title="4. 初始化第一个服务：logger"></a>4. 初始化第一个服务：logger</h2><p>在 skynet 启动时，首先会创建一个日志服务实例。它通过 <code>skynet_context_new()</code> 将一个服务模块实例化。这个过程本质上是：</p><ul><li>根据模块名从服务模块表中查找服务对象。</li><li>创建一个新的实例。</li><li>注册一个全局句柄。</li><li>创建消息队列。</li><li>调用模块的初始化函数。</li></ul><p>最终，skynet 就会把这个服务放进消息调度系统中，后续的消息就能被正确投递。</p><h2 id="5-启动-bootstrap：第一个-Lua-服务"><a href="#5-启动-bootstrap：第一个-Lua-服务" class="headerlink" title="5. 启动 bootstrap：第一个 Lua 服务"></a>5. 启动 bootstrap：第一个 Lua 服务</h2><p>在完成基础模块初始化之后，skynet 会开始加载 bootstrap 引导服务。默认配置中，<code>bootstrap</code> 的内容通常是：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">snlua bootstrap<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>也就是说，skynet 会启动一个名为 <code>snlua</code> 的服务，并把 <code>bootstrap</code> 作为它的初始化参数。随后，bootstrap 服务会根据配置中提供的 luaservice 路径去寻找对应的 Lua 脚本。</p><p>bootstrap 的核心逻辑由一个函数完成：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">bootstrap</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> skynet_context *logger, <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *cmdline)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> sz = <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(cmdline);<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> name[sz + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>];<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> args[sz + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>];<br><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">sscanf</span>(cmdline, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s %s&quot;</span>, name, args);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">skynet_context</span> *<span class="hljs-title">ctx</span> =</span> skynet_context_new(name, args);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ctx == <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>) &#123;<br>        skynet_error(<span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Bootstrap error : %s\n&quot;</span>, cmdline);<br>        skynet_context_dispatchall(logger);<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这段逻辑的作用非常简单：把字符串 <code>snlua bootstrap</code> 拆分成模块名和参数，然后创建对应的服务实例。</p><h2 id="6-snlua：Lua-服务的沙盒环境"><a href="#6-snlua：Lua-服务的沙盒环境" class="headerlink" title="6. snlua：Lua 服务的沙盒环境"></a>6. snlua：Lua 服务的沙盒环境</h2><p><code>snlua</code> 是 skynet 中最重要的 Lua 服务载体之一。它本质上是一个 Lua 沙盒环境，每一个 Lua 服务都会在独立的 Lua 虚拟机中运行。</p><h3 id="6-1-实例化过程"><a href="#6-1-实例化过程" class="headerlink" title="6.1 实例化过程"></a>6.1 实例化过程</h3><p>在 <code>snlua</code> 模块中，创建实例时会调用下面的逻辑：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> snlua *<span class="hljs-title function_">snlua_create</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">snlua</span> *<span class="hljs-title">l</span> =</span> skynet_malloc(<span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(*l));<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">memset</span>(l, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(*l));<br>    l-&gt;mem_report = MEMORY_WARNING_REPORT;<br>    l-&gt;mem_limit = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    l-&gt;L = lua_newstate(lalloc, l);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> l;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这一步的重点是：为每个 Lua 服务创建一个独立的 Lua VM，避免不同服务之间互相污染环境。</p><h3 id="6-2-初始化过程"><a href="#6-2-初始化过程" class="headerlink" title="6.2 初始化过程"></a>6.2 初始化过程</h3><p>实例创建完成后，还需要做初始化工作：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">snlua_init</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> snlua *l, <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> skynet_context *ctx, <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *args)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> sz = <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(args);<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *tmp = skynet_malloc(sz);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">memcpy</span>(tmp, args, sz);<br><br>    skynet_callback(ctx, l, launch_cb);<br>    <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *self = skynet_command(ctx, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;REG&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-type">uint32_t</span> handle_id = strtoul(self + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>, <span class="hljs-number">16</span>);<br><br>    skynet_send(ctx, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, handle_id, PTYPE_TAG_DONTCOPY, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, tmp, sz);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里完成了两件重要的事情：</p><ul><li>给当前服务注册回调函数；</li><li>给自己发送一条初始化消息。</li></ul><p>当这条消息被处理时，就会进入 <code>launch_cb()</code>，它会进一步加载 Lua 环境、设置路径变量，并最终执行入口脚本。</p><h2 id="7-Lua-层的入口：bootstrap-lua"><a href="#7-Lua-层的入口：bootstrap-lua" class="headerlink" title="7. Lua 层的入口：bootstrap.lua"></a>7. Lua 层的入口：bootstrap.lua</h2><p>当底层 C 逻辑完成之后，控制权就会转移到 Lua 层。skynet 会加载并执行 bootstrap.lua，这个文件就是整个 Lua 服务启动链路的起点。</p><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs lua"><span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> skynet = <span class="hljs-built_in">require</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;skynet&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> harbor = <span class="hljs-built_in">require</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;skynet.harbor&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">require</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;skynet.manager&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> memory = <span class="hljs-built_in">require</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;memory&quot;</span><br><br>skynet.start(<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> sharestring = <span class="hljs-built_in">tonumber</span>(skynet.<span class="hljs-built_in">getenv</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;sharestring&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> <span class="hljs-number">4096</span>)<br>    memory.ssexpand(sharestring)<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> standalone = skynet.<span class="hljs-built_in">getenv</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;standalone&quot;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> launcher = <span class="hljs-built_in">assert</span>(skynet.launch(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;snlua&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;launcher&quot;</span>))<br>    skynet.name(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;.launcher&quot;</span>, launcher)<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> harbor_id = <span class="hljs-built_in">tonumber</span>(skynet.<span class="hljs-built_in">getenv</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;harbor&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> harbor_id == <span class="hljs-number">0</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">assert</span>(standalone == <span class="hljs-literal">nil</span>)<br>        standalone = <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>        skynet.setenv(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;standalone&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span>)<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> ok, slave = <span class="hljs-built_in">pcall</span>(skynet.newservice, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;cdummy&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> ok <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br>            skynet.abort()<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">end</span><br>        skynet.name(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;.cslave&quot;</span>, slave)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> standalone <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">pcall</span>(skynet.newservice, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;cmaster&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br>                skynet.abort()<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">end</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">end</span><br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> ok, slave = <span class="hljs-built_in">pcall</span>(skynet.newservice, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;cslave&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> ok <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br>            skynet.abort()<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">end</span><br>        skynet.name(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;.cslave&quot;</span>, slave)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">end</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> standalone <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> datacenter = skynet.newservice <span class="hljs-string">&quot;datacenterd&quot;</span><br>        skynet.name(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;DATACENTER&quot;</span>, datacenter)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">end</span><br><br>    skynet.newservice <span class="hljs-string">&quot;service_mgr&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">pcall</span>(skynet.newservice, skynet.<span class="hljs-built_in">getenv</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;start&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;main&quot;</span>)<br>    skynet.<span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>()<br><span class="hljs-keyword">end</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个脚本的作用并不只是“启动一个服务”，而是整个 skynet 初始化的关键步骤：</p><ul><li>启动必要的基础服务；</li><li>注册内部服务名；</li><li>创建 <code>service_mgr</code>；</li><li>根据配置启动真正的业务服务；</li><li>最后退出 bootstrap 过程。</li></ul><h2 id="8-skynet-start：Lua-服务的标准入口"><a href="#8-skynet-start：Lua-服务的标准入口" class="headerlink" title="8. skynet.start：Lua 服务的标准入口"></a>8. skynet.start：Lua 服务的标准入口</h2><p>在 Lua 侧，所有服务都会通过 <code>skynet.start()</code> 作为标准启动入口。它的实现逻辑非常简单：</p><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs lua"><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">skynet.start</span><span class="hljs-params">(start_func)</span></span><br>    c.callback(skynet.dispatch_message)<br>    skynet.timeout(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br>        skynet.init_service(start_func)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">end</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">end</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里的核心思想是：</p><ul><li>先把 Lua 回调函数注册到 C 层；</li><li>当后续收到消息时，就由 <code>dispatch_message</code> 统一处理。</li></ul><h2 id="9-总结"><a href="#9-总结" class="headerlink" title="9. 总结"></a>9. 总结</h2><p>从源码角度来看，skynet 的启动过程可以概括为一个清晰的链路：</p><ol><li>入口函数读取配置文件并准备环境。</li><li>初始化各个底层模块，如消息队列、句柄、网络、定时器和服务模块。</li><li>创建日志服务实例。</li><li>启动 bootstrap 服务。</li><li>bootstrap 进一步创建 <code>snlua</code> 服务，并加载 Lua 脚本。</li><li>Lua 层的 <code>bootstrap.lua</code> 负责启动一系列基础服务和业务服务。</li></ol><p>因此，skynet 的启动并不是单纯“启动一个进程”，而是一个“从 C 层初始化框架，再把控制权交给 Lua 层”的完整流程。只有把这条链路理清楚，后续在分析消息派发、服务调度、定时器和网络模块时，才会更容易把握整体架构。</p>]]></content>
      
      
